        "original_id": "857a0021-3b66-5671-a89f-a0518c5ca7b9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chino Moreno, Sergio Vega\n- Bands and Projects: Deftones, Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, Palms\n- Songs and Albums: “Tempest”, “Koi No Yokan”\n- Places: Sacramento, California\n- Websites: PureVolume\n\nFacts:\n- Deftones is a Sacramento, California-based alternative metal band.\n- “Tempest” is the second single by Deftones from their seventh studio album “Koi No Yokan”.\n- “Tempest” debuted on PureVolume’s official website on October 3, 2012 with a video featuring Chino Moreno and Sergio Vega discussing the track.\n- Chino Moreno is a member of Deftones.\n- Chino Moreno is also a member of the side-project groups Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, and Palms.",
